  "bio": "Reggie Cuvelier is a highly skilled tattoo artist, well-versed in illustrative and fine line styles, ensuring each piece is crafted with meticulous detail and precision. Clients commend Reggie not only for the striking artistry but also for maintaining a pristine and hygienic workspace, which mirrors their commitment to professionalism. If you're looking for an artist who can translate your vision into ink with exceptional cleanliness, Reggie at RSTattooNY is the one to book.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattoo @rstattoony\nBass @disruptor_ny \nIllustration n Design @1141.prod \n217 Washington St Binghamton\nBookings commissions: \nreggieinks@gmail.com\n\nTattoo @rstattoony\nBass @disruptor_ny \nIllustration n Design @1141.prod \n217 Washington St Binghamton\nBookings commissions: \nreggieinks@gmail.com",
